></g></svg></mjx-container>) (since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.13ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6245.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(1056,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">m</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1933.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2989.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4489.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4656.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">cm</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5856.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can rearrange the formula for (H) to solve for (I) :</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.108ex\" height=\"2.765ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 3583.6 1222\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(781.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1837.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1166,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(559.1,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><rect width=\"1506\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Substituting the given values, you get :</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20.488ex\" height=\"3.502ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1187.1 9055.6 1547.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(781.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1837.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,516.8) scale(0.707)\"><g d